privacy-heading = Your data
privacy-intro = Download your account data or request account deletion. Guest mode does not create an account or saved player data.
privacy-account = Account: { $login }
privacy-sign-in = Sign in to download or delete your data. You can cancel an earlier deletion request below.
privacy-export = Download account data (JSON)
privacy-export-started = The browser has been asked to download the file.
privacy-export-saved = Your data file was saved to the selected location.
privacy-delete = Delete account
privacy-busy = Finish your active duel, trade, tournament or expedition first.
privacy-master = Transfer clan leadership to another member or disband the clan first.
privacy-delete-warning = You are requesting deletion of { $login }. All sessions will end and you will leave your clan. You have 30 days to cancel. After that, contact details, messages, collection and Dukats will be removed. Combat and settlement history will retain a replaced identity; necessary security records have separate retention.
privacy-confirm-login = Enter the exact account login
privacy-password = Current password
privacy-ack = I understand the consequences and want to request account deletion.
privacy-confirm-delete = Request account deletion
privacy-working = Processing…
privacy-requested = Request accepted and sessions ended. For 30 days, you can cancel deletion using your login or email and existing password.
privacy-restore-title = Cancel a deletion request
privacy-restore-help = If fewer than 30 days have passed, enter your account credentials. Cancellation does not restore old sessions or clan membership, and does not remove moderation bans.
privacy-identity = Login or email of the account to restore
privacy-restore = Cancel account deletion
privacy-restored = Request cancelled. You can sign in again.
privacy-leave = Leave this form? Unsubmitted details will be lost.
privacy-error-DEFAULT = The operation was not confirmed. Please try again. An interrupted export download may leave an incomplete file.
privacy-error-UNAUTHENTICATED = Check your password and session. Cancellation is available only for 30 days after the request.
privacy-error-PRIVACY_ADMIN = An administrator or moderator account requires the service owner to remove its staff privileges first.
privacy-error-CLAN_MASTER = Transfer clan leadership or disband the clan first.
privacy-error-BUSY = Finish your active game or trade first.
privacy-error-RATE_LIMITED = Too many attempts. Please try again later.
privacy-error-SESSION_CHANGED = The account session changed. Reload the page and try again.

privacy-login-title = Access your data without gameplay
privacy-login-help = This 15-minute session only permits access to your data and account deletion, including for banned accounts. It does not lift a ban or sign you into the game.
privacy-login-identity = Account login or email
privacy-login = Verify identity for data access
privacy-logout = End data access session

privacy-error-INVALID_CREDENTIALS = The password is incorrect. Check it and try again.
